# Money & accounting

- All money columns: `DECIMAL(15,2)`. Never `float` / `double`.
- Every multi-table write (fees, vouchers, journals) must run inside `DB::transaction()`.
- Posted journal entries are immutable — do not update/delete; post a reversing journal instead.

```php
// ❌ BAD — mutate posted entry
$entry->update(['narration' => $new]);

// ✅ GOOD — reverse
DB::transaction(function () use ($entry) {
    $this->journalService->reverse($entry);
});
```

Every Service that moves money needs a feature test covering success + rollback on failure.
